" y=\"92\" font-family=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"normal\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"middle\">edit</text><text x=\"235\" y=\"140\" font-family=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"normal\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"middle\">show</text><line x1=\"470\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"572.8\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><polygon points=\"580,100 571,95.1 571,105\" fill=\"#2563eb\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"580\" y1=\"122\" x2=\"477.2\" y2=\"122\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><polygon points=\"470,122 479,127 479,117.1\" fill=\"#2563eb\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"525\" y=\"92\" font-family=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"normal\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Format</text><text x=\"525\" y=\"140\" font-family=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"normal\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Parse</text><text x=\"380\" y=\"40\" font-family=\"Menlo, Consolas, monospace\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"normal\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Normalize(Parse(Format(P))) == Normalize(P)</text><text x=\"380\" y=\"188\" font-family=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"normal\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"middle\">names in the text resolve to stable ids — a renamed point keeps working</text></svg>",
